Project Development Phase 
The Project Development Phase is the stage where the planned design is converted into a working project or product.
Main steps:
Develop the project – Build the project according to the design.
Implement features – Add the required functions and components.
Write code – Develop the software if it is a software project.
Test the project – Check whether everything works correctly.
Fix errors – Identify and correct bugs or problems.
Finalize the project – Prepare the working project for demonstration.
